# B01: validação do cadastro (tudo deve dar 400)
###############################################################

### corpo que é array
POST {{base}}/players
Content-Type: application/json

[]

### agility como texto
POST {{base}}/players
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "X Teste", "position": "MEI", "agility": "85", "age": 25, "pace": 70, "shooting": 68, "passing": 82, "dribbling": 79, "defending": 55, "physical": 64, "potential": 86 }

### nome só com espaços
POST {{base}}/players
Content-Type: application/json

