# B14 a B16: venda
###############################################################

### vende o Meia Lua: 200 (multa, lucro, comissão, club_cash)
POST {{base}}/players/{{pMeia.response.body.$.id}}/sell

### venda de novo (já livre): 409
POST {{base}}/players/{{pMeia.response.body.$.id}}/sell

### venda de jogador excluído: 404
POST {{base}}/players/{{pDel.response.body.$.id}}/sell

### volta para os livres
GET {{base}}/players?free=true&search=meia

