GET {{base}}/clubs/{{cA.response.body.$.id}}/transactions?player_id={{pMeia.response.body.$.id}}

###
GET {{base}}/clubs/{{cA.response.body.$.id}}/transactions?type=COMPRA&player_id={{pMeia.response.body.$.id}}

